
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Privacy Policy of Croft Family Cottages in Naran";
    ViewBag.keywords = "Hotel policy, Naran hotel, room cancellation policy";
    ViewBag.canonical = "https://thecroftcottages.com/privacy-policy";
    ViewBag.Description = "Explore transparent privacy policy of Croft Family Cottages Naran to understand how we handle your information, ensuring a secure and enjoyable stay.";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<br />
<br />
<div class="container">
    <!-- Main title -->
    <div class="main-title">
        <h1>
            Privacy Policy of The Croft Family Cottages in Naran
        </h1>
    </div>
    <div class="row">

        <p>
            At Croft Family Cottages Naran, we are dedicated to providing more than just accommodation; we offer an experience of tranquility and warmth. Our commitment extends to ensuring your comfort, safety, and privacy throughout your stay with us. Here's a detailed overview of our privacy policy, designed to transparently communicate how we handle your information and maintain a secure and enjoyable environment.
        </p>

        <h2>Information Collection</h2>
        <p>
            During the reservation process, we collect basic personal information such as your name, contact details, and payment information. This data is used exclusively for booking purposes and is stored securely in compliance with data protection regulations.
        </p>


        <h3>Reservation Security</h3>

        <p>We understand the sensitivity of your payment information. Rest assured that all transactions are encrypted and processed through secure channels, ensuring the confidentiality and integrity of your financial details.</p>
        
        <h3>Email Communication</h3>
        <p>By providing your email address during booking, you may receive occasional updates, exclusive offers, and newsletters from Croft Family Cottages Naran. We value your privacy, and you have the option to unsubscribe from these communications at any time.</p>
       

        <h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
        <p>
            While our website may contain links to third-party websites or services, it's important to note that their privacy policies may differ from ours. We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of these entities independently.
        </p>
        

        <h3>Cookie Usage</h3>
        <p>
            To enhance your browsing experience, we use cookies that collect non-personal information. These cookies help us understand user behavior, preferences, and improve our website functionality over time.
        </p>
        
        <h3>
            Data Security
        </h3>
        <p>Croft Family Cottages Naran prioritizes the security of your personal information. Our systems undergo regular updates to ensure they meet the highest security standards, protecting your data from unauthorized access.</p>
        
        <h3>
            Policy Updates
        </h3>
        <p>
            Our privacy policy is subject to occasional updates to reflect any changes in our practices. We encourage you to review our policy periodically to stay informed about how we handle your information.
        </p>
        <h3>
            Children's Privacy
        </h3>
        <p>
            We understand the importance of children's privacy. Our services are not directed to anyone under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us, and we will take appropriate steps to remove that information.
        </p>        

        <h3>Contact Us</h3>
        <p>
            Should you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding our privacy policy or the handling of your data, our team is readily available to assist you. Feel free to reach out, and we'll be happy to address any inquiries you may have.
        </p>
        <p>
            By choosing Croft Family Cottages Naran, you not only select a destination but a haven where your privacy and comfort are paramount. We appreciate the trust you place in us and strive to exceed your expectations during your stay. Thank you for making us part of your Naran experience.
        </p>

     
    </div>
</div>
